Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 12:03:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] [megatron] feat: project LM head only for response tokens

Select next-token-aligned loss-mask rows before the vocabulary projection, then restore scalar token outputs to the regular layout. Preserve tensor/sequence/context-parallel semantics and fail closed for unsupported fused, MTP, and top-k paths.

Assisted-by: OpenAI Codex
